  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Alright, 2 o\u2019clock sounds good yeah. We can go to one of the study
      rooms, though we need to be gone before the janitor comes to kick us out. I
      heard he\u2019s in a pretty bad mood these past few days. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Really? I thought he was always pretty nice. What happened? '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: 'Apparently he misplaced the universal key for the storage cabinets and
      electrical rooms. Which, yknow, is kinda important. So the director gave him
      quite the scolding. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: '*winces* Oh man, that sucks.'
    videoEventId: 
